{"5268900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"dlc","name":"Dark and Darker - EAS11 Seasonal Pack","steam_appid":5268900,"required_age":"17","is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Darker EA Season 11 – Seasonal Pack<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witches gather when the moon hangs highest, brewing potions older than memory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Season 11 Seasonal Pack welcomes you into this season's Witch-touched world with a permanent potion skin, a taste of premium currency, and the essential season conveniences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EA#11 Seasonal Pack Contents:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Cosmetic (Yours Forever!)<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Skin: <strong>Raven's Brew<\/strong> – Carried with you into every dungeon run, forever.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Currency<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redstone Shards +2<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season-Limited Convenience<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+1 Shared Stash<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+5 Marketplace Slots<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Supplies (Seasonal Consumables)<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Great Potion of Luck ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Bandage (3) ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Lockpick (3) ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Potion of Healing (3) ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Potion of Protection (3) ×12<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Containers<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Gold Coin Bag (Non-tradable) ×3<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Gold Coin Pouch (Non-tradable) ×6<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC is non-refundable.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season-limited items (marketplace slots, shared stash, consumables, and gold containers) expire when the season ends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent cosmetics remain after the season ends.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Darker EA Season 11 – Seasonal Pack<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witches gather when the moon hangs highest, brewing potions older than memory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Season 11 Seasonal Pack welcomes you into this season's Witch-touched world with a permanent potion skin, a taste of premium currency, and the essential season conveniences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EA#11 Seasonal Pack Contents:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Cosmetic (Yours Forever!)<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Skin: <strong>Raven's Brew<\/strong> – Carried with you into every dungeon run, forever.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Currency<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redstone Shards +2<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season-Limited Convenience<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+1 Shared Stash<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+5 Marketplace Slots<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Supplies (Seasonal Consumables)<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Great Potion of Luck ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Bandage (3) ×12<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Lockpick (3) ×12<\/p><\/l